{"zh":[{"start":2.83,"end":4.81,"text":"日耳曼人的时尚潮流。"},{"start":5.04,"end":7.98,"text":"男人们对自己的头发大费周章，"},{"start":8.05,"end":12.3,"text":"他们用万能武器——梳子——仔细打理头发。"},{"start":12.53,"end":15.39,"text":"头号护发品是黄油。"},{"start":15.54,"end":17.91,"text":"过一阵子黄油会开始发臭，"},{"start":17.94,"end":19.46,"text":"这没人在乎。"},{"start":19.58,"end":22.01,"text":"特别流行的是苏维汇发髻，"},{"start":22.07,"end":26.17,"text":"就是把头右侧的头发编成一个结。"},{"start":28.3,"end":30.96,"text":"起初它是苏维汇人之间的识别标志，"},{"start":31.0,"end":34.18,"text":"后来在其他部落里也成了流行款。"},{"start":35.6,"end":40.73,"text":"美容工具里还有镊子和挖耳勺。"},{"start":40.81,"end":43.32,"text":"洗漱包装得满满的。"}],"de":[{"start":2.83,"end":4.81,"text":"Modetrends der Germanen.","words":[["Modetrends","时尚潮流"],["der","这"],["Germanen.","日耳曼人。"]],"reading":"莫德特伦茨 德尔 格尔马嫩。"},{"start":5.04,"end":7.98,"text":"Großen Wirbel machten die Männer um ihre Haare,","words":[["Großen","大"],["Wirbel","漩涡"],["machten","做"],["die","这"],["Männer","男人"],["um","围绕"],["ihre","他们的"],["Haare,","头发，"]],"reading":"格罗森 维尔贝尔 马赫滕 迪 门纳 乌姆 伊雷 哈雷，"},{"start":8.05,"end":12.3,"text":"die sie mit ihrer Allzweckwaffe, dem Kamm, ausgiebig frisierten.","words":[["die","它们"],["sie","他们"],["mit","用"],["ihrer","他们的"],["Allzweckwaffe,","万能武器，"],["dem","这"],["Kamm,","梳子，"],["ausgiebig","仔细"],["frisierten.","梳理。"]],"reading":"迪 齐 米特 伊雷尔 阿尔茨韦克瓦费，德姆 卡姆，奥斯吉比希 弗里西尔滕。"},{"start":12.53,"end":15.39,"text":"Das Haarpflegemittel Nummer eins war Butter.","words":[["Das","这"],["Haarpflegemittel","护发品"],["Nummer","号"],["eins","一"],["war","是"],["Butter.","黄油。"]],"reading":"达斯 哈尔普弗莱格米特尔 努默 艾因斯 瓦尔 布特尔。"},{"start":15.54,"end":17.91,"text":"Dass sie nach einiger Zeit anfängt zu stinken,","words":[["Dass","那"],["sie","它"],["nach","在"],["einiger","一些"],["Zeit","时间"],["anfängt","开始"],["zu","去"],["stinken,","发臭，"]],"reading":"达斯 齐 纳赫 艾尼格尔 蔡特 安芬特 楚 施廷肯，"},{"start":17.94,"end":19.46,"text":"interessierte nicht.","words":[["interessierte","关心"],["nicht.","不。"]],"reading":"因特雷西尔特 尼希特。"},{"start":19.58,"end":22.01,"text":"Besonders beliebt war der Su